   129	
   130	The Codex installer appends one block to `~/.codex/config.toml` disabling
   131	Codex's bundled `skill-creator`, leaving `skill-craft` canonical; the rest of
   132	that file is preserved.
   133	
   134	From the product checkout,
   135	`scripts/manage_installation.py uninstall-managed --target <skills-dir>`
   136	reclaims the harness-owned skill links and nothing else. The bootstrap line and
   137	the Codex block remain until removed by hand.
   138	
   139	MCP bootstrap enrols only the exact nearest Git root or an exact current
   140	directory whose Git probe proves `not-repository`. Other paths fail closed with
   141	`WORKSPACE_NOT_TRUSTED`; direct sibling collections, including valid bare Git
   142	repositories, name children, while a standalone bare Git root is refused.
   143	Malformed evidence gets repair guidance, linked-worktree exceptions require
