    50	
    51	## Decision
    52	
    53	Every file the installer touches belongs to exactly one of three owners. A
    54	fourth class, machine-local derived state, is not owned by either repository
    55	and is never committed anywhere.
    56	
    57	| Class | Owner |
    58	|---|---|
    59	| runtime, scripts, schemas, skills (managed), workflows, HARNESS.md | product-shipped projection |
    60	| risk-policy, review-profiles, delivery-profiles, adapter-compatibility | product-shipped projection |
    61	| instance `agent-fabric.yaml` local layer | instance-owned (narrowing-only) |
    62	| AGENTS.md, model-preferences.json, model-routing.json | seeded once, then instance-owned |
    63	| third-party skill sources (`custom-skills/`) | instance-owned, committed |
    64	| desired state (product version, mode) | instance-owned, committed |
    65	| installation receipts, generated `skills/` projection, client links | machine-local, ignored |
    66	
